    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d425">

                <pb facs="0651" n="577" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg577"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Hale</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 33.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1866-07-07"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi>
                            7, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Information has been received at this
                    department from the United States consul at Malaga that an order had been issued
                    to the sanitary board of Cadiz, Seville, and Malaga, directing them to consider
                    all ports of the United States as infected with cholera. This information was
                    communicated to the Secretary of the Treasury. I have now to enclose a copy of
                    his reply, and also to instruct you to take such measures with reference to the
                    restriction of the quarantine imposed upon vessels of the United States by her
                    Catholic Majesty’s government as may seem to you to be advisable under the
                    circumstances.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">John P. Hale,</hi> Esq.,<hi rendition="#italic">
                            &amp;c</hi>., <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d425-a1.xml" xpointer="d425-a1"/>
            </div>
